{"id": "unknown-2026-07-20-015", "date": "2026-07-20", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 30, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["installation_demand", "industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Ukraine recognizes solar installer as official profession", "content": "<p>The recognition will serve as a foundation for future education programs, professional certifications and training as Ukraine works to ensure the quality of solar installations is maintained amid rapid deployment of distributed systems.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/20/ukraine-recognizes-solar-installer-as-official-profession/\">Ukraine recognizes solar installer as official profession</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/20/ukraine-recognizes-solar-installer-as-official-profession/", "type": "rss"}]}
